<title>USA: Universal Outdoor acquires Lamar unit.</title>
<headline>Universal Outdoor acquires Lamar unit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Outdoor Inc on Tuesday said it completed the acquisition of the Baltimore market of Penn Advertising from Lamar Advertising Inc.</p>
<p>Universal's acquisition was structured as a stock purchase at about $46.5 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Universal has acquired about 1,450 display faces in the Baltimore metropolitan area, it said.</p>
